menu "Bluetooth"

comment "Controller library selection"

config BLECONTROLLER_LIB
    string "BLE controller library variant (bl602/bl702)"
    help
      Name of the prebuilt BLE controller library to link (for example
      "m1s1").  Only the variants provided for the selected chip are
      accepted (bl602/bl702: m0s0sp, m0s1, m0s1p, m0s1s, m16s1, m1s1,
      m2s1, m8s1); the build aborts on unknown values or when the
      remaining options conflict with the selected library.

config BTBLECONTROLLER_LIB
    string "Bluetooth controller library variant (btble SoCs)"
    help
      Name of the prebuilt Bluetooth+BLE controller library to link (for
      example "ble1m2s1bredr1").  Only the variants provided for the
      selected chip are accepted (bl616/bl618dg: ble1m0s1bredr0,
      ble1m0s1sbredr0, ble1m0s1sbredr1, ble1m10s1bredr0, ble1m10s1bredr1,
      ble1m2s1bredr0, ble1m2s1bredr1, ble1m4s1bredr1, blespihci,
      bleuarthci, mfg, uarthci, wlanif; bl702l: m0s1p, m0s1rp, m0s1sp,
      m0s2p, m0s4p, m1s1p, m1s1t10, m2s1p, m4s1p, m8s1p, uarthci,
      uarthcilp; bl616cl: m0b1, m0s1, m2s1, mfg, uarthci, wlanif); the
      build aborts on unknown values or when the remaining options
      conflict with the selected library.

